  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Camara Semences Seeds Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereal (seed). Beneficiaries: 200 (10 women). Description: The project will promote activities to increase production, including training of old and new producers on improved seed production techniques; technical assistance and financial management support (hiring an accountant, an accounting firm to certify financial statements, and audits) to facilitate access to bank loans to increase access to foundation seed and fertilizer; construction of a 500 ton warehouse, a delivery vehicle, improved packaging to improve seed quality and market access.</narrative>
  </description>
